    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "\uff08tokenizers== 0.21.1\uff09\nWhen training with Chinese corpus, OOMerrors occur\uff0c100GB of RAM can only support approximately 1.5GB of JSONL training data.\nHowever, when training with English corpus, 100GB of RAM can support at least 10GB or more of JSONL training data.\nThis issue is consistent with problem #1681, but appears to be related to the language of the training corpus. We hope this information will help in resolving the problem.",
